{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月14日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16th Single 「愛MUST BE」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売日です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売日はCDショップに行きたくなります"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も行こうかなーー…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛MUST BE"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/G0NTHaW8eXw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自称バレエダンサー"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/G0NTHaW8eXw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "元凶"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/88-asxwFoI4"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ見ていただきたいです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しいミュージックビデオが完成するたびに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり櫻坂が好きだなあって思います"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/moboMMzos.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobSk3xq2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケット写真のオフショット"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優が撮ってくれた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobc8jvmK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツーショットも撮った"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久々~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はクールな感じのメイクだったから"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カラコンつけてみた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりだったので目がゴロゴロしてました…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またライブとかでつけたいですね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobTryhNr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobt7zN39.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ撮影でも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何枚かツーショット撮れました !"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浅井ちゃん初めてかも。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しいなーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobstcsZe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いっ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大園さんはいつだって可愛い !"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週は歌番組にも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん出演させていただくので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧ください"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16th Singleも楽しみましょうね ⭐︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}